        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "For real \\(a\\), the minimum value of \\(y=\\left|x-2\\right|+\\left|x-a\\right|\\) is \\(5\\). Find \\(a\\).",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "By the triangle inequality, \\(\\left|x-2\\right|+\\left|x-a\\right|\\ge\\left|a-2\\right|\\). Hence \\(\\left|a-2\\right|=5\\), giving \\(a=-3\\) or \\(a=7\\).",
        "question_audio": null,
        "time_limit_seconds": 30,
        "points": 10,
        "sort_order": 6,
